PR Title: stream_join_dynamic: Assert inp readies only for selected streams

PR #236 (Merged October 4, 2024)

Description:
The PR addresses a bug where successful handshakes on output ports would assert `ready=1` on all input ports regardless of the `sel_i` selection parameter. This caused unwanted handshakes on unselected input channels that had `valid=1`. The proposed fix ensures only selected input channels receive the ready signal.

